@startuml
title Gym media: CORS preflight for a cross-origin fetch

actor User
participant "Browser" as Client
participant "MediaWorker" as Worker
participant "Router" as Router
participant "Cors" as Cors

User -> Client: load exercise page
Client -> Worker: OPTIONS /media/pushups/01.gif\norigin: https://app.example
Worker -> Router: route(request)
Router -> Cors: preflightResponse(request, allowedOrigins)
Cors --> Router: 204 { access-control-allow-origin, allow-methods, max-age }
Router --> Worker: 204
Worker --> Client: 204 (preflight pass)
Client -> Worker: GET /media/pushups/01.gif
note right of Client
  Follow-up request completes
  per the sequence in
  sequence-get-media.puml
end note

@enduml
